<title>LATVIA: HANSABANK-LATVIJA JOINS CIRRUS, OTHER NETWORKS.</title>
<headline>HANSABANK-LATVIJA JOINS CIRRUS, OTHER NETWORKS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian-owned Hansabank-Latvija said on Thursday that it has joined the card networks of Cirrus, edc/Maestro and Eurocard/Mastercard.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that the cards added to its existing Globus and Hansabank-Latvija cards.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
